cs      │ Clawdbot documentation expert with decision tree            │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │                  │ navigation, search scripts, doc fetching, version           │                        │\n│           │                  │ tracking, and config snippets for all Clawdbot features     │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 clawdhub       │ Use the ClawdHub CLI to search, install, update, and        │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │                  │ publish agent skills from clawdhub.com. Use when you need   │                        │\n│           │                  │ to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to    │                        │\n│           │                  │ latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill  │                        │\n│           │                  │ folders with the npm-installed clawdhub CLI.                │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 cron-scheduler │ Schedule and manage periodic tasks using cron-like          │ openclaw-managed       │\n│           │                  │ scheduling                                                  │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 find-skills    │ Helps users discover and install agent skills when they     │ agents-skills-personal │\n│           │                  │ ask questions like \"how do I do X\", \"find a skill for X\",   │                        │\n│           │                  │ \"is there a skill that can...\", or express interest in      │                        │\n│           │                  │ extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the  │                        │\n│           │                  │ user is looking for functionality that might exist as an    │                        │\n│           │                  │ installable skill.                                          │                        │\n│ ✓ ready   │ 📦 frontend-      │ Create distinctive, production-grade frontend in